## Quickstart

Requires Docker with the Compose plugin.

```bash
cp .env.example .env   # adjust ports and credentials
make up                # docker compose up -d --build
make logs              # follow logs
make down              # stop everything
```
{%- if tables %}

## Database

The schema is applied automatically from `db/init.sql` the first time the database container starts (`make reset` wipes it and re-applies).

| Table | Columns |
